    "answer": "The reserve for product warranties increased by $6 million from 2005 to 2006. The change is explained as $4 million of 2006 pretax warranty charges plus $7 million of warranty obligations assumed in acquisitions, less $5 million of cash outlays, which reconciles the reserve from $4 million at the end of 2005 to $10 million at the end of 2006.",
